+ nesnd_supply_status_war:0 "#n War has reached the trading routes.#! Requisitions and disrupted shipping have broken the previous period of stability.\n$nesnd_supply_rules_link$"
+ nesnd_supply_status_inputs:0 "#n Workshops and garrisons lack reliable supplies.#! Paper, tools and arms are straining their budgets.\n$nesnd_supply_rules_link$"
+ nesnd_supply_status_jobs:0 "#n Workshops and offices still lack workers.#! More posts must be filled to sustain their business.\n$nesnd_supply_rules_link$"
