- nesnd_supply_hus_preparations_reason:0 "东洲诸邦在反抗吴人的战争中结为共和国，商人、船主与移民把沿海城镇连成一体。北朝的盟约和共同市场又为这片土地带来了新的生意，工坊采购原料，港口运出本国的产品。\n\n如今南朝的争端牵动着海外商路。[ROOT.GetCountry.GetName]需要查清哪些生产掌握在自己手中，哪些货物仍由远方运来。留在北朝市场经营，或争取独立的贸易安排，都要让官署、工坊和普通家庭能够维持生计。"
+ nesnd_supply_hus_preparations_reason:0 "Immigrants and merchant ships built the republic’s coastal towns. War against Wu brought its states together; the northern alliance opened further markets. Work in the harbours, production in the mills and provincial revenue now depend upon these connections.\n\nNews of the southern dispute crosses the ocean. Whether we continue in the shared market or arrange our own trade, production and livelihoods at home must endure."
