- nesnd_south_pressure_detail_tt:0 "#bold Succession Pressure#!: #v [Country.MakeScope.ScriptValue('nesnd_south_pressure_value')|1] / 100#!\nCurrent monthly net change: #v [Country.MakeScope.ScriptValue('nesnd_south_monthly_pressure_value')|1]#!. While the East–West conflict journal is active, pressure rises by #n 1#! monthly, or #n 0.4#! with the Federal Compact modifier. This growth stops when that journal ends.\n\nAfter one month of commission expenses, each qualifying monthly review reduces pressure by #p 3#!. Signing or renewing accords has no immediate pressure effect. Peace requires pressure below #v 60#! and the remaining route and observation conditions."
