- nesnd_south_succession_board_reason:0 "The Zhu emperor retains the dynastic title. The Zheng house commands the central forces, revenues and principal overseas colonial network. The coastal provinces sustain its military and commercial power, while the regional governments maintain their own forces and industries within the common market. A change of dynasty will reopen questions of appointments, tribute, military obligations and overseas trade."
