  nesnd_land_rules:0 "#bold Current statistics#!\nUnemployed share of workforce: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_reform_unemployment').GetValue|%1]#!\nWorkforce in starving households: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_reform_starving').GetValue|%1]#!\nWorkforce-weighted household SoL: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_reform_sol').GetValue|1]#!\nPopulation-weighted market access: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_reform_access').GetValue|%1]#!\n\n#bold Healthy month#!\nPeasant proprietorship, commercialized or collectivized agriculture; schools level 2 and 48% literacy; unemployment at most 6%, starvation at most 8%, SoL at least 11, market access at least 85%; nonnegative bureaucracy, peace and no active [concept_bankruptcy] penalty. Social security level 2 with SoL 12 permits unemployment up to 12%.\n\nHealthy months add 2 progress and reduce disorder by 1. With land rights, unemployment at most 10%, starvation at most 12%, SoL 10.5, access 80%, schools level 1 and no active [concept_bankruptcy] penalty, partial progress adds 0.5 monthly. Completion requires 100 progress, twelve consecutive healthy months and disorder below 50. Completion within 48 months with 24 healthy months and disorder below 30 earns an additional reward.\n\nThese monthly indicators cover currently owned reform states, including Shengjing, Outer Manchuria and Amur. National and state unemployment use unemployed workforce divided by total workforce. Market access is weighted by state population; SoL and starvation by pop workforce. Subsistence peasants count as employed.\n\n#bold Regional living conditions#!\nA state with at least 500,000 people interrupts consolidation if unemployment exceeds 20%, starving workforce exceeds 25%, or severely starving workforce exceeds 10% for six consecutive months. Actual employment, basic goods supply, relief or industrial adjustment must bring it below these severe-hardship thresholds."
  nesnd_ten_status_bankruptcy:0 "An active [concept_bankruptcy] penalty interrupts consolidation."
  nesnd_ten_conditions_bar_detail:0 "Unemployed workforce: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_ten_unemployment').GetValue|%1]#!\nHungry workforce: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_ten_starving').GetValue|%1]#!\nEmployed and hungry: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_ten_working_hungry').GetValue|%1]#!\nWorkforce-weighted living standards: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_ten_sol').GetValue|1]#!\nMarket access: #v [Country.MakeScope.Var('nesnd_ten_access').GetValue|%1]#!\n\nTargets: unemployment <=12%; hunger <=25% and living standards >=6.5; access >=85%; peace and no active [concept_bankruptcy] penalty. Workforce shares are refreshed monthly. Subsistence farmers are employed."
